  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Aspire Fortitude Studio is a gym apparel brand built for those who train with purpose, confidence, and conviction. Our products are designed for athletes, lifters, and everyday people who want apparel that looks sharp, feels comfortable, and represents discipline inside and outside the gym.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our brand blends fitness, lifestyle, and faith-inspired values while still being made for both Christian and non-Christian audiences. We focus on premium gym wear, clean designs, and a strong message of strength, endurance, and self-improvement.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Affiliates can earn commission by promoting Aspire Fortitude Studio through social media, fitness content, gym lifestyle posts, product reviews, reels, stories, and direct referrals. Affiliates will receive a custom link and/or coupon code to share with their audience.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are looking for creators, athletes, gym-goers, and motivated individuals who align with our mission and want to help grow a brand built around fortitude, performance, and purpose.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div>",
